{"parse": {"title": "谋杀始于清晨-01", "pageid": 110537, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD%E5%AE%89%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8\" title=\"玛丽安娜·谋杀始于清晨\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">谋杀始于清晨-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B0%8B%E6%9D%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8-02\" title=\"谋杀始于清晨-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">谋杀始于清晨</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BE.8E.E5.A5.BD.E5.B9.B4.E4.BB.A3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"美好年代\">美好年代</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 美好年代</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">La Belle Époque</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"sufubihaozhai\"><img alt=\"sufubihaozhai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/600px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/900px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-sufubihaozhai.png/1200px-Cg-sufubihaozhai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>午后的鲁昂乡村瞌睡在阳光里。屋内，艾格尼丝语气平稳地念诵经书，透出虔诚的安乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜伏在妹妹的手边，轻声跟读，试图让经文厚重地落到心里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>“洞察人心的，知晓圣灵的意思，因为圣灵照着神的旨意替圣徒祈求。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>“爱神的人得天主一切协助，就是照祂旨意蒙召的人……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝的声音渐远，窗外知更鸟的鸣叫吸引了玛丽安娜的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世代衔着圣人之血的鸟，歌声会带来救赎，但她只觉得烦闷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎被不断提醒着，一场因她而起的争吵此刻在另一座宅邸里尚未停歇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……不！玛丽，别再想了，聆听经文时该怎么做？专心虔敬……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>玛丽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……艾格尼丝，怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>这该由我来问你呀。你匆忙地来见我，要我为你读经，可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>玛丽，刚刚我读的是哪一章节？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>艾格尼丝，你是知道的……我……向来没有你熟悉这些文字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝不赞同地望着她，不发一言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……好吧，我不该撒谎，这是主所厌恶的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝没有打断她，以眼神鼓励玛丽安娜敞开心怀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>你知道吗，艾格尼丝……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>如果现在去到巴黎，我们将在塞纳河畔见到来自世界各地的新东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>姑母说，数千盏白炽灯会照亮黑夜，脚下地铁会一路疾驰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>还有“电影”！马儿会在幕布上真实地奔跑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这些话压抑了太久，得到机会便像河水般涌了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>噢！是你之前和我说过的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>嗯……万国博览会，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜知道妹妹对此并不关心，巴黎的喧闹远不如一句简短的箴言能让她心神澎湃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但艾格尼丝会展现恰到好处的关心与好奇，体贴地托住玛丽安娜的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>没错！我太想去了，就拜托了姑母，她好心地答应了我，还说顺道带我去埃菲尔铁塔上看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>可爸爸对万博会深恶痛绝，认为华而不实的技术，只会阻挡我们聆听神的箴言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我出门前，姑母还在和爸爸争吵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>这是我不愿看到的，或许……我真不该有这样的念头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>嗯……我也害怕大人们的争吵，他们总是不在意用语言伤害彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>可这也明明违背了主的教导呀，天父要我们与人和睦，远离纷争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>嬷嬷也说我们所做的一切都必然符合神的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>就像两天后，我要去到圣利济耶的修道院，说不定神的旨意也必要你去巴黎呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝的话语公正而善良，仿佛不只是为了宽慰玛丽安娜，而在于时刻践行神的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>谢谢你，艾格尼丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>呼……现在就算读再多经文，对你来说用处都不大啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>一会儿去苹果园逛逛吧，我偶尔能闻到苹果熟透后的清香……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾格尼丝的话还未说完，一阵匆忙的脚步声便从走廊传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女佣：</div><div>玛丽安娜小姐，收好东西，您的姑母正在屋外等着您呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女佣：</div><div>就是您想去的万国博览会呀！快，趁老爷还没后悔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜诧异地看向艾格尼丝，后者略显惊讶，但即刻露出了真诚的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>看，玛丽，现在你就要坐上姑母的车去到巴黎，而我将在苹果园享受我的午后——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-528501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾格尼丝：</div><div>神已为我们安排好了一切。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_huanchengdadao_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大皇宫的玻璃拱顶将阳光淬炼成晶莹的质地，支撑这座宏伟建筑的繁复铁艺让人联想到年轻的埃菲尔铁塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>站在香榭丽舍大街上，玛丽安娜从拥挤的人流中抬起头，新世界的光晕染红了她的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>姑母！下一站是不是你说的“典雅厅”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜迫不及待地望向身后急忙追上的苏珊娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>慢些！要是弄丢了你，你父亲说什么我都哑口无言了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>爸爸只给了我两天时间，当然不能在一个地方停留太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>……我保证，一定带你把所有的东西都看完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏珊娜叹了口气，走上前握紧小女孩的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>前面就是典雅厅，里面展出的，都是现在被称作“高级定制服”的作品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>踏入展厅，繁复华贵的服装作品令她目眩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>看你的左边，是沃斯先生的设计……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精致的刺绣花纹，优雅的裙摆轮廓，每一寸都在拓展设计的边界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在此之前，玛丽安娜从未想过衣服本身可以成为新时代的一种诠释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>……他不仅是第一位创立高级时装店的人，还——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>姑母，这些纹路是怎么绣上去的？还有这些褶皱，是怎么缝制的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好奇的小姑娘打断了苏珊娜的介绍，她哑然一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>……玛丽，要不要试着自己探索一下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>巴黎出版了不少时装杂志，有些会刊载这些高级工艺，我会邮寄给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>要是爸爸发现了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>我会想办法。况且，你父亲并不总是正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜不解地看向自己的姑母，后者俏皮地眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>他唾弃新时代的技术，对巴黎孕育的每一样事物都视而不见，可这些都已在改变我们的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>试想看，如果每个人都像你父亲那样生活，眼前的一切还有可能出现吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>答案必然是否定的，恪守经文的人没有这样的创造力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这位“离经叛道”的家庭成员，轻而易举地说出了大胆的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我……我不知道，我从来没有想过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>不着急，你还有很长的时间来思考，我只是想告诉你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>你还可以选择一种“新”的生活方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-514001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏珊娜：</div><div>来，抓紧时间，战神广场的电力宫也不能错过呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜愣怔地跟上苏珊娜的脚步，再次汇入人流。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "谋杀始于清晨-01"}}